                            <formatted-text>
                              <run fontsize='12'>Customers can be broken into 4 groups</run>
                              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                              <run fontsize='12'>- </run>
                              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>VIP Customers</run>
                              <run fontsize='12'> (High frequency, higher spenders), </run>
                              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Regular Customers</run>
                              <run fontsize='12'> (High frequency, lower spenders), </run>
                              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Returning Customers</run>
                              <run fontsize='12'> (Low frequency, lower spenders but have returned (low recency)), </run>
                              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>At Risk Customers</run>
                              <run fontsize='12'> (Low frequency, lower spenders with high recency)</run>
                              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                              <run fontsize='12'>The majority of churning customers are low spenders with low frequency</run>
                              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                              <run bold='true' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Actionable Recommendations:</run>
                              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                              <run fontsize='12'>Introduce bundling specials to increase average order value, re-engagement offers for outstanding returning customers, and prioritize retention with exclusive perks.</run>
                              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                            </formatted-text>
